'''Guadalupe Ledezma Sanchez''' (October 28, 1961 – April 28, 2025) was an American professional [[American football|football]] player who was a [[defensive back]] and [[Return specialist|kick and punt returner]] for the [[Pittsburgh Steelers]] of the [[National Football League]] (NFL) from 1986 to 1988. He played [[college football]] for the [[UCLA Bruins football|UCLA Bruins]].
